
  <section class="mb-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-content">
          <p class="eyebrow">Join Mere&nbsp;Orthodoxy</p>
          <h2 class="mb-hero-headline"><em>Mere&nbsp;Orthodoxy</em> is a <span class="highlight">reader-supported publication.</span></h2>
          <p class="mb-hero-sub">
            Mere&nbsp;Orthodoxy is able to produce top-notch essays and podcasts on faith, church, and culture because of readers just like you.
          </p>
          <p class="mb-hero-sub">
            If you believe in quality Christian media for the sake of renewal, join us.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mb-hero-image" aria-hidden="true">
          <img src="{{asset "images/membership-hero.jpg"}}" alt="Stack of Mere Orthodoxy journals" fetchpriority="high" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="section-intro section-intro-light mb-hero-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Membership</p>
        <h2 class="section-heading section-heading-light"><em>Support the work.</em></h2>
        {{#match @member.status "paid"}}
          <a href="/give/" class="btn btn-primary mb-hero-gift-cta" data-hm-goal="gift">Gift A Membership</a>
        {{else}}{{#match @member.status "comped"}}
          <a href="/give/" class="btn btn-primary mb-hero-gift-cta" data-hm-goal="gift">Gift A Membership</a>
        {{/match}}{{/match}}
      </div>
    </div>
    {{!-- Annual/Monthly toggle: pricing-only, so hidden for
         paid/comped members who see the gift CTA above and the
         "already a member" block below instead. --}}
    {{#match @member.status "paid"}}{{else}}{{#match @member.status "comped"}}{{else}}
      <div class="toggle-wrap" role="tablist" aria-label="Billing interval">
        <div class="toggle">
          <button type="button" class="toggle-option is-active" data-interval="annual" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-hm-goal="plan-annual">
            Annual
            <span class="badge">Save 17%</span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="toggle-option" data-interval="monthly" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-hm-goal="plan-monthly">Monthly</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    {{/match}}{{/match}}
  </section>

  {{!-- Pricing vs "already a member" is gated by paid/comped status.
       Free Subscribers AND anonymous visitors both see the pricing
       cards. --}}
  {{#match @member.status "paid"}}
    {{> "membership-already"}}
  {{else}}{{#match @member.status "comped"}}
    {{> "membership-already"}}
  {{else}}
    {{> "membership-pricing"}}
  {{/match}}{{/match}}

  <section class="readers">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">Readers</p>
        <h2 class="section-heading"><em>From our readers.</em></h2>
      </div>

      <blockquote class="reader-feature">
        I'm very grateful for the work of Mere&nbsp;Orthodoxy. It has been a genuine companion on my spiritual journey.
      </blockquote>

      <div class="readers-grid">
        <blockquote class="reader-quote">
          <p>Thank you for offering thoughtful, reasonable and decent commentary. It is a boon to my sanity at this stage of my life in this cultural moment.</p>
        </blockquote>
        <blockquote class="reader-quote reader-quote--long">
          <p>I used to be a campus minister with a parachurch organization. In finding Mere&nbsp;Orthodoxy, it has felt like a little more balance in perspectives like I had when I worked for the ministry. Appreciate your work as it grows my faith.</p>
        </blockquote>
        <blockquote class="reader-quote">
          <p>Mere&nbsp;Orthodoxy is (for me) a counterpoint to social media, a place of depth and critical thought.</p>
        </blockquote>
      </div>

      <blockquote class="reader-feature reader-feature--coda">
        I love Mere&nbsp;Orthodoxy! One of the best protestant publications out there!
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="included">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="included-heading">What You're Supporting</h2>
