          <h3>Long-Form Essays</h3>
          <p>Writing on theology, culture, and spiritual formation built for rereading, not the news cycle.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <span class="benefit-numeral">II</span>
          <h3>The Print Journal</h3>
          <p>A quarterly of serious Protestant thought, printed and mailed four times a year.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <span class="benefit-numeral">III</span>
          <h3>Mere Fidelity</h3>
          <p>The flagship podcast. Long, patient conversations about theology, church, and the life of faith.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <span class="benefit-numeral">IV</span>
          <h3>Christians Reading Classics</h3>
